  "ingredients": [
    "16 ounce boneless, skinless chicken thighs",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "12 ounce zucchini (spiralized into noodles)",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "2 tablespoon coconut oil",
    "3/4 medium yellow onion (cut into thick slices)",
    "4 ounce broccoli (cut into small florets)",
    "14 ounce canned coconut milk",
    "2 tablespoon green curry paste",
    "2 tablespoon peanut butter",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1 ounce peanuts (finely chopped, for topping)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all of your ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-green-chicken-curry-with-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-56654-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Green-Chicken-Curry-with-Zoodles-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season chicken thighs with salt and pepper, then cook over medium heat until cooked through. About 4 minutes on each side.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-green-chicken-curry-with-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-56654-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Green-Chicken-Curry-with-Zoodles-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once cooked, cut the chicken into bite-sized pieces and set aside. You can optionally use pre-cooked chicken or even shredded rotisserie chicken in a pinch.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-green-chicken-curry-with-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-56654-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Green-Chicken-Curry-with-Zoodles-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spiralize the zucchini and season with salt. Stir to incorporate.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-green-chicken-curry-with-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-56654-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Green-Chicken-Curry-with-Zoodles-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the zoodles in between some paper towels, then place a bowl or other heavy object on top to press any excess moisture out of the zoodles.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-green-chicken-curry-with-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-56654-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Green-Chicken-Curry-with-Zoodles-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat coconut oil in a pan over medium-high heat. Once hot, add in the onion and broccoli. Sauté for a few minutes, stirring frequently, until crisp but tender.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-green-chicken-curry-with-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-56654-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Green-Chicken-Curry-with-Zoodles-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the coconut milk, curry paste, peanut butter, and chicken then stir well to combine. Allow to simmer for a few minutes, reducing slightly and thickening up. Remove from the pan and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-green-chicken-curry-with-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-56654-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Green-Chicken-Curry-with-Zoodles-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the same pan, heat the olive oil for the zoodles. Once hot, add in the zoodles and sauté for a few minutes until soft but not mushy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-green-chicken-curry-with-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-56654-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Green-Chicken-Curry-with-Zoodles-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add back in the curry and mix everything together to incorporate.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-green-chicken-curry-with-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-56654-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Green-Chicken-Curry-with-Zoodles-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve immediately, sprinkling over crushed peanut as garnish. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-green-chicken-curry-with-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-56654-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
